[
    {
        "content": "<p>Several years ago, I spent weeks attempting to formalize the Euler Characteristic of a polytope (or any graph) in Isabelle, with the hope of then using it to prove the number of platonic solids and Pick's theorem.</p>\n<p>(All of this was after reading a delightful book called \"Euler's Gem\" by Dave Richeson that describes these arguments in prose.)</p>\n<p>All of these items happened to be on <a href=\"https://www.cs.ru.nl/~freek/100/\">Freek Wiedijk's famous list of 100 theorems</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/13\">#13</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/50\">#50</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/92\">#92</a> ). </p>\n<p>Lawrence Paulson eventually ported the Euler characteristic from HOL light over to Isabelle, but AFAIK, nobody picked up the other two.</p>\n<p>Anyway, I had Grok Bot port <em>his</em> port to lean,  and fill in the other two results. It took about 5 hours of work time for the whole thing, spread out over 2 days.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tangentproofs.github.io/eulers-gem/\">https://tangentproofs.github.io/eulers-gem/</a></p>\n<p>I'm still reviewing but there is a Results.lean file with hyperlinked code, and it claims to have verified with Comparator.</p>",
        "id": 626684152,
        "sender_full_name": "Michal Wallace (tangentstorm)",
        "timestamp": 1790270688
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It's a bit hard to audit your <a href=\"https://tangentproofs.github.io/eulers-gem/docs/Results.html\">results</a> since all of the theorems rely on custom <code>EulersGem</code> namespace definitions. Could you try refactoring this to only use Mathlib definitions? What are we missing to be able to state these?</p>",
        "id": 626759820,
        "sender_full_name": "Jack McCarthy",
        "timestamp": 1790295193
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>These are the \"Pick's theorem\" in the file, but I replaced the proof with simpler ones</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results_picks_of_funkenbusch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">heuler</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hverts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hedges</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">harea</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">qify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">heuler</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hverts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hedges</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results_picks_of_triangulation</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hV</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hF</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">heuler</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hshake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">harea</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">qify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hF</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">heuler</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hshake</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 626761590,
        "sender_full_name": "Weiyi Wang",
        "timestamp": 1790296284
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I expected to see some definition of area of a geometric object to appear in the statement</p>",
        "id": 626761774,
        "sender_full_name": "Weiyi Wang",
        "timestamp": 1790296375
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>My understanding is that we're missing a big chunk of general theory on polytopes, but it's also true that there's a lot of extra aliases and whatnot. I'll have it do a simplification pass.</p>",
        "id": 626761806,
        "sender_full_name": "Michal Wallace (tangentstorm)",
        "timestamp": 1790296390
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Okay, the code above indicates that these are trivial algebraic identities and don't actually reflect anything about polytopes. This is certainly not what we would want for the <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/100.html\">100 Theorems</a> site. </p>\n<p>Luckily, there are many smart people working on polyhedral geometry in Mathlib, so hopefully we will have the technology to state these soon!</p>",
        "id": 626762469,
        "sender_full_name": "Jack McCarthy",
        "timestamp": 1790296755
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It seems like this still needs quite a bit of work. I'll keep it running.</p>",
        "id": 626770283,
        "sender_full_name": "Michal Wallace (tangentstorm)",
        "timestamp": 1790301285
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/35069\">#35069</a> (boundary of a polygon) was a start towards another attempt at Pick but needs work (or reimplementation) to address review comments and hasn't seen any activity lately. Given boundary of a polygon, you can define interior and then area using measure theory, then link it to other versions of area that are more convenient to work with.</p>",
        "id": 627009924,
        "sender_full_name": "Joseph Myers",
        "timestamp": 1790376782
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://tangentproofs.github.io/eulers-gem/docs/Results.html\">https://tangentproofs.github.io/eulers-gem/docs/Results.html</a> is much cleaner now, showing only the 3 headline theorems.</p>\n<p>Pick's Theorem now looks much closer to the shape I'd expect, with an actual area formula.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/-- **Pick's theorem** for a strictly convex counterclockwise lattice polygon</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">with distinct vertices. If `S` is the set of interior lattice points, the</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">Lebesgue area of the convex hull is `I + B/2 − 1`, where `I = #S` and `B` is</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">the number of boundary lattice points. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results_picks_theorem</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Picks</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LatticePolygon</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℤ</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">interiorLatticePoints</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hverts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Injective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">vertex</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hsc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Picks</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LatticeFan</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">StrictlyConvexCCW</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">MeasureTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">volume</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">convexHullRegion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">ENNReal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofReal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Picks</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LatticeArea</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">volume_eq_ofReal_cardI_add_B_div_two_sub_one_no_pe</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hverts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hsc</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 627178376,
        "sender_full_name": "Michal Wallace (tangentstorm)",
        "timestamp": 1790485264
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The platonic solids part is a bit verbose, but you can see the Schläfli notation if you just look at the last two numbers for each one. (ex: (8, 12, 6, 4, 3) =&gt; {4,3} means the faces have 4 vertices, and 3 meet at each vertex, describing a cube):</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/-- **The five Platonic solids** are the tetrahedron, the cube, the octahedron,</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">the dodecahedron, and the icosahedron. Each line is `(V, E, F, s, m)`: `s` sides</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">per face, `m` faces at each vertex. These five Schläfli pairs are all of them:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">every combinatorially regular polyhedron, with `V − E + F = 2`, is one of these. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">results_five_platonic_solids</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tetrahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tetrahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tetrahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tetrahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tetrahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cube</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cube</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cube</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cube</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cube</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">octahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">octahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">octahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">octahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">octahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dodecahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dodecahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dodecahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dodecahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dodecahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">icosahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">icosahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">icosahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">icosahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">icosahedron</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">schlafliPairs</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">RegularNumbers</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">schlafliPairs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">card_schlafliPairs</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EulersGem</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Platonic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">schlafli_pair_mem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
